  "details": "Whenever I load a world that isn't public - even when loading into my home world - it disconnects me (error message appears but it is invisible) and places me in a public version of the world. I can hear and sometimes see the world about a second before it disconnects every time. I also found out that the screenshots I try to take during this don't save. Once in the public world, everything seems to work fine, and I can also join my friends worlds even when they are non-public.",
